  "description": "The proposal involves the conversion of a single dwelling at 48 Upland Rd, SE22 0DA, into two self-contained flats: a two-bedroom flat on the first floor and a four-bedroom flat on the ground floor. \nThe conversion will retain the architectural character of the building, providing modern and functional living spaces, with independent entrances, private outdoor amenity areas and secure cycle storage. This proposal will make efficient use of the existing property while integrating harmoniously with the surrounding residential area."
